      "side": 1,
      "message": "Mostly observations inline. I think the main thing to look at is the behavior of newrev being set to `\u0027\u0027` vs `None` and whether we should make that more consistent in all cases.",
      "revId": "a9dc6b03c2898c0dd2f9fb27fd78476cc3caa07a",
