      "writtenOn": "2025-05-14T22:29:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, and the overall API need here is just to get the sha of the project-branch, so it\u0027s not more specific than necessary.  Within the drivers, some of them find the easiest way to do that is to get the sha of an arbitrary ref, but as Simon points out below, we want to use project-specific internal methods when necessary.\n\n(Resolving since this is a nit.)",
