      "writtenOn": "2025-05-15T05:28:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, wfm. However, I DO think we may want to revisit the error handling here and in the other places and call at least `response.raise_for_status()` in order to get a better error message instead of a `JSONDecodeError`.",
